# Credentials that belong to a person, never to the repository — the preview's password
# (docs/review/ACCOUNTS.md points here).
/docs/review/*.local.md
# The review accounts' passwords, rotated on 02.10.2026 after the repository had been public (D-141).
/docs/review/ACCOUNTS.md

# Generated by `npm run ocr:assets` (the on-device Fahrzeugschein scan): ~17 MB of worker,
# WebAssembly cores and language data copied from node_modules and jsDelivr at build time.
/public/ocr

# The acceptance run's saved sign-ins: a storage state is a live session (tests/abnahme/auth.setup.ts).
/tests/abnahme/.auth/

# Human QA evidence (screenshots, exports, the meeting PDF): never committed while the repository is public.
/storage/qa-evidence/
